    <guid isPermaLink="false">6671075ec26e396a36913dec</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Jun 2024 04:04:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello hello大家好，欢迎收听，尊重他人生活的播客节目，这档播客的成员呢是来自于另一档播客粉丝群的粉丝，大家因为都太喜欢聊天了。交朋友和聊天是这一群陌生人的共同爱好，所以我们就录了这么一个由网上邻居组成的闲聊播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那今天是618了，在这样购物氛围浓厚的节日里，我们录了一期关于物欲的聊天内容，最终话题也不可避免的聊到了大家的消费观和理财观，那你最近有什么样的物欲烦恼吗？一起来跟我们聊聊天吧！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期摘要</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">02:39</a>三万和他的百万淘宝首页</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 粥粥到底要不要买苹果手表</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a>买不起的才是物欲？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a>我们聊物欲的时候到底在聊什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="552">09:12</a>是物欲还是消费主义陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a>如何解决物欲上头？买它！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">15:16</a>买东西之前问问自己这些问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1172">19:32</a>物欲和童年理财教育</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a>粥粥的理财小课堂</span></p><span></span><p><span>三万和他的百万淘宝首页：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk3E3o9FNMF-IMb-_l7J3XTUppm-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsThDlGCz2DwemFiCj81zjM2C-EX.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsJlVFrz9CnZtklYSUM8xaTUYTz4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlzM7GoAZgA4nJru1jXDbyrjK9E5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>买东西之前问问自己这些问题：</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk8-2avuMV_yZsPRr4i7tbyveNc8.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
