  <item>
    <title>和网上邻居一起聊聊：我就乐意这么活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66603ea494977a26ef68f0b3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66603ea494977a26ef68f0b3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Jun 2024 10:32:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello大家好，欢迎来到尊重他人生活的午夜聊天时间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期聊聊，我们作为天南海北，来自不同地方的网友们的现在生活的状态。</span></p><span></span><p><span>比如说我其实小时候只想离开家长大了之后，我没有想到我能在大城市里乞讨。我小时候射出的子弹，就好像一下子打到了现在。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">02:06</a> &nbsp;不想进入职场的山雀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">02:43</a> &nbsp;渴望进入职场的主任</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">11:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;小马的转行经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;柯基要自己的自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="949">15:49</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;饺子皮的人生就没有在选择，也可以说是每时每刻都在选。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1097">18:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;人生就是值了——想读建筑的喂喂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1156">19:16</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;把好朋友“倒”海里的三万，想把朋友凑一起玩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">21:22</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;畅想一下十年后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">23:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;总有人默默爱你</span></p><span></span><p><span>那我们下期再见，如果还有的话。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqDyZR_vQ90T93dDKxwKuBR4xLbj.m4a" length="36149984" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:24:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frkhw2zIm4qxG4FYANKAES5yPGPX.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>和网上邻居一起聊聊自己的高光时刻</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664d62134efbc0c3dc3654a3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664d62134efbc0c3dc3654a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 May 2024 03:10:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello hello大家好，欢迎收听，尊重他人生活的播客节目，这档播客的成员呢是来自于另一档播客粉丝群的粉丝，大家因为都太喜欢聊天了。交朋友和聊天是这一群陌生人的共同爱好，所以我们就录了这么一个由网上邻居组成的闲聊播客节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在快节奏的现代生活中，焦虑、紧张、不安，自我怀疑，还有种种负面情绪，已经成为了人们生活中的一部分。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们会分享一些身边朋友们的高光时刻，期望能给大家打一剂强心针，让苦涩的生活多些甜味。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a>带领大家逃课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a>拿了“爽文”男主剧本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a>英语口语童子功</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a>带着父母出游，太牛了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a>好朋友上春晚了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1414">23:34</a>“亲密关系”里的高光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a>好友的肯定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a>“特殊”的生日惊喜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a>电动车是这个世界最方便的交通工具，摩托是最好的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a>他！来了！又走了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a>“村霸”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lg7A7lvub_29qkx5AphvC7XDSP8Y.m4a" length="41789021" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtHICGDl9ciNxoIx9J7wFPn86yId.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
